  "body": "## What's Changed\n* fix(release): make adopter acceptance portable on macOS by @xinglun in https://github.com/xinglun/ai-cockpit/pull/330\n* docs: compare pinned reference files batch 16 by @xinglun in https://github.com/xinglun/ai-cockpit/pull/331\n* fix(ci): model post-merge closure transition by @xinglun in https://github.com/xinglun/ai-cockpit/pull/332\n* docs: align WI-369 terminal status by @xinglun in https://github.com/xinglun/ai-cockpit/pull/334\n* perf: dynamically reuse exact verification for Work Items by @xinglun in https://github.com/xinglun/ai-cockpit/pull/333\n* WI-372: recover WI-370 provider finalization by @xinglun in https://github.com/xinglun/ai-cockpit/pull/335\n* WI-373: recover WI-371 provider finalization by @xinglun in https://github.com/xinglun/ai-cockpit/pull/336\n* release: v0.2.39 preparation and parity recovery by @xinglun in https://github.com/xinglun/ai-cockpit/pull/337\n* docs: promote WI-374 after verified close by @xinglun in https://github.com/xinglun/ai-cockpit/pull/338\n\n\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/xinglun/ai-cockpit/compare/v0.2.38...v0.2.39",
